<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<script>
document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-bs-theme',
    localStorage.getItem('uic-theme')
        ?? (matchMedia('(prefers-color-scheme: dark)').matches ? 'dark' : 'light'));
</script>
<base href="../">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>lit-todo · p2p</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="./web_modules/bootstrap/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="./p2p/p2p.css">
{{ importmap | safe }}
<script type="module" src="./@schuhkarton/lit-todo/todo-app.js"></script>
<script type="module" src="./p2p/p2p.js"></script>
</head>
<body class="py-4">
<main class="container">
<todo-app class="d-block mb-4"></todo-app>
<section class="card pairing">
<div class="card-header">pair another browser</div>
<div class="card-body">
<p class="status text-body-secondary" id="status">Share this list over WebRTC — no server carries the state.</p>
<div id="host-controls">
<button id="share" class="btn btn-primary">share this list</button>
<div id="offer-block" hidden>
<div class="qr" id="offer-qr"></div>
<p>Scan with the other device's camera — its browser opens this page with the offer aboard. The raw offer travels any other way too:</p>
<textarea id="offer-text" class="form-control font-monospace" readonly></textarea>
<h3 class="h6 mt-3">then the answer comes back</h3>
<button id="scan" class="btn btn-outline-secondary mb-2" hidden>scan the answer</button>
<video id="camera" hidden playsinline></video>
<textarea id="answer-input" class="form-control font-monospace" placeholder="uics1.…"></textarea>
<button id="connect" class="btn btn-primary mt-2">connect</button>
</div>
</div>
<div id="guest-block" hidden>
<p>Show this answer to the host — scan or copy it back.</p>
<div class="qr" id="answer-qr"></div>
<textarea id="answer-text" class="form-control font-monospace" readonly></textarea>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<footer class="text-center small mt-3">
<a class="link-secondary" href="./">← share through the server instead</a>
</footer>
</main>
</body>
</html>
